      "content": "\"Investment ready\" sounds good, but they're going to dig deep into the patent's stability. If they ask about any ongoing litigation or if there are any vulnerabilities in the data processing patent that could affect its longevity, what's our official line? I don't want them getting spooked and trying to lowball us.",
